  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NTGD124.NightBossSpawner
  _componentDescription: Spawns the one-time night boss (Monster35) once the player
    is level 6+, the miasma quest is fully turned in, and night begins - whichever
    of those three happens last triggers the spawn. Adds the Monster quest and removes
    it once the boss is defeated (MobHealth's 100-hit default, same as any Hard mob).
