  m_text: 'Soul Crystals : drop from hard mobs, usually found on outer part''s of
    the map, or in the miasma fog.


    Night & Day - Mushrooms / Flowers : spawn
    either only at night or only at day night behind mountains. (name dependant spawn)


    Regular
    Mushrooms / Flowers : by the river.


    Bones / Meat / Skin : drop from monsters.


    Rock
    and wood - from rocks and trees.

'
